1. Educational & Non-Commercial Purpose
This project is created and made available strictly for educational, academic, learning, and research demonstration purposes. It demonstrates agricultural market intelligence, real-time price discovery, and multi-mandi analytics using publicly accessible Indian Government Open Data (AGMARK via data.gov.in).

