3. Data & Third-Party Attribution
All agricultural market returns, commodity names, arrival dates, and mandi benchmark records referenced in this system originate from official Indian Open Government Data initiatives (AGMARK / data.gov.in) and remain subject to the respective National Data Sharing and Accessibility Policy (NDSAP) guidelines.

